<Base title="Help" description="Where your purchase lives, how invites work, refunds, and how to reach Sébastien.">
  <h1>Help</h1>
  <p class="lead">Most questions are one of these five. If yours isn't, the email is at the bottom.</p>

  <h2>Where is the thing I bought?</h2>
  <p><b>Bought on the store or on Gumroad:</b> everything is in your <a href="https://gumroad.com/library">Gumroad library</a>, under the email you used at checkout. Vault zips, PDFs, videos, license keys, Notion and Trello links. No account needed to buy, but creating a free one keeps the library in one place.</p>
  <p><b>Invited to Knowii (any reason):</b> you have at least Explorer access, plus the spaces of every product you own. <a href="/knowii">The map</a> explains which is which.</p>
  <p><b>Subscribed to Knowii on knowii.net (Circle):</b> your bonuses live inside Knowii, in the product spaces and the <a href="https://www.knowii.net/courses">Courses</a> area, unlocked per tier. Workshop recordings are in the <a href="https://www.knowii.net/c/events-and-office-hours?pastEvents=true&sort=desc&iframe=false">Events and Office Hours</a> archive.</p>

  <h2>I subscribed to Knowii and nothing happened</h2>
  <p>I send every Knowii invite myself, within 24 to 48 hours. If it's been longer, or you can't find the email, write to <a href="mailto:sebastien@developassion.be">sebastien@developassion.be</a> with the email you paid with.</p>

  <h2>Refunds, cancellations, mistakes</h2>
  <p>Thirty-day money-back guarantee on every product, no questions. Subscriptions are managed from your Gumroad account (or Circle, if that's where you joined). Details in the <a href="https://www.store.dsebastien.net/faq/">store FAQ</a>; the <a href="https://www.store.dsebastien.net/help/">store help page</a> has the rest.</p>

  <h2>Students and tight budgets</h2>
  <p>Ask. I'd rather you learn than wait. Same email.</p>

  <h2>Updates, articles, news</h2>
  <p>Every buyer, from any channel, is subscribed to my newsletter. That's where product updates are announced. Everything I publish lives at <a href="https://dsebastien.net">dsebastien.net</a>: <a href="https://www.dsebastien.net/blog/">articles</a>, <a href="https://www.dsebastien.net/newsletter/">newsletter</a>, <a href="https://www.dsebastien.net/news/">news</a>.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href="mailto:sebastien@developassion.be">sebastien@developassion.be</a>, or a post in the relevant Discussions space in Knowii (faster, and others learn from the answer).</p>
</Base>
